conflicts_with:         []
prerequisite_of:        []

# ═══ 元数据 ═══
doc_file:               knowledge/drafts/E551-draft-BAS1.md
last_updated: 2026-10-14
source_event:           KProperty 3.2.0 r5 aborted in two original GUILESS tests; r6/r7 switching to QApplication changed this to a modal timeout. Source traced KDefaultPropertyFactory -> setupPrivateIconsResourceWithMessage -> QStandardPaths RCC lookup. r8/r9 restored original GUILESS sources and exposed the installed share directory, passing all three upstream entries. r9 also passed five installed-consumer assertions including Qt5 QM translation; full 12-receipt W3_PASS, log SHA256 0de754bbcc306f2bd21f8953da597db94b81a9e0282c5e85d6a7189fd60f41a0.

